# Common Mistakes

❌ Running `terraform apply` without reviewing the plan

❌ Committing `terraform.tfstate` to Git

❌ Hardcoding AWS credentials

❌ Using the root AWS account

❌ Editing infrastructure manually in the AWS Console after Terraform manages it

